@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      8-1
' realizes:     FR-05, FR-06, FR-07, FR-09, FR-13, FR-14, FR-18, FR-20, NFR-04, NFR-05
' source:       backend/src/models/, STT_Whisper/src/mongodb_uploader.py（schema 與 uploader）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  partial
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依目前集合、參照與限制重繪非 UML 關聯圖
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title MongoDB核心集合關聯圖
left to right direction

rectangle "非 UML：文件型資料庫集合關聯與限制" as Label

package "帳號與課程" {
  rectangle "users\nemail unique\nlineUserId unique+sparse" as Users
  rectangle "avatars\nuserId unique" as Avatars
  rectangle "courses\nteacherId ref\nvideoIds[] refs" as Courses
  rectangle "enrollments\n(studentId, courseId) unique\nactive / revoked" as Enrollments
}

package "影片與知識" {
  rectangle "videos\ncourseId / uploadedBy refs\nprocessing state" as Videos
  rectangle "videobatches\nbatchId unique\nitems[].videoId" as Batches
  rectangle "video_segments_text\nvideoId bridge\nchunkId index" as Leaf
  rectangle "parent segments\nparentId unique\nchildChunkIds[]" as Parent
}

package "問答與營運" {
  rectangle "conversations\nuserId / courseId refs" as Conversations
  rectangle "messages\nconversationId ref" as Messages
  rectangle "questions\nuserId / courseId\ncitation snapshot" as Questions
  rectangle "faqs\n(courseId, normalizedQuestion) unique" as Faqs
  rectangle "notifications\nrecipientId ref\ndedupe partial unique" as Notifications
  rectangle "shortscripts / shortassets\ncourse / script / YouTube refs" as Shorts
}

Users --> Avatars : 1 : 0..1
Users --> Courses : teacher 1 : 0..*
Users --> Enrollments : student 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Enrollments : 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Videos : 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Batches : 1 : 0..*
Batches --> Videos : 1 : 0..10
Videos --> Leaf : 1 : 0..*\nvideoId bridge
Parent --> Leaf : 1 : 1..*\nchildChunkIds
Users --> Conversations : 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Conversations : 1 : 0..*
Conversations --> Messages : 1 : 0..*
Users --> Questions : 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Questions : 1 : 0..*
Questions --> Leaf : citation 0..* : 1
Courses --> Faqs : 1 : 0..*
Users --> Notifications : recipient 1 : 0..*
Courses --> Shorts : 1 : 0..*

note bottom of Label
  MongoDB 不強制外鍵；參照完整性、課程授權與 detach／delete 邊界由 service 層維護。
  Parent retrieval 為 guarded path；shared Atlas 實際集合與 index 狀態須另做唯讀查證。
end note

@enduml
